            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Your use of the Image is governed by Alamyâ€™s terms and conditions which can be accessed here:&#xA;https://www.alamy.com/terms/default.asp &#xA;Rights Managed&#xA;Image information is liable to change; it is your responsibility to check before you use an image.&#xA;Please check on https://www.alamy.com/image-details.asp?aref=2CYRW59&#xA;The image has the following Release Information at 29 June 2022;&#xA;Model Release : No&#xA;Property Release : No&#xA;The image has the following restrictions at 29 June 2022:&#xA;All Countries, Advertising and promotion, All Medias, All Industries, All Sub-Industries&#xA;All Countries, Consumer goods, All Medias, All Industries, All Sub-Industries&#xA;All Countries, Direct mail and brochures, All Medias, All Industries, All Sub-Industries&#xA;All Countries, Indoor display, All Medias, All Industries, All Sub-Industries&#xA;All Countries, Internal business usage, All Medias, All Industries, All Sub-Industries&#xA;All Countries, Commercial electronic, All Medias, All Industries, All Sub-Industries&#xA;All Countries, Personal use, All Medias, All Industries, All Sub-Industries</rdf:li>
