         <dc:creator>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li>John Moore</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">NEWTOWN, CT - JANUARY 14:  Photos of Sandy Hook Elementary School massacre victims sits at a small memorial near the school on January 14, 2013 in Newtown, Connecticut. The town marked a month anniversay since the massacre of 26 children and adults at the school, the second-worst such shooting in U.S. history.  (Photo by John Moore/Getty Images)</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
